# Web app configuration. Copy to `.env.local` ONLY if you want account sync.
#
# Leave this file uncopied and the planner runs fully local: plans live in your
# browser, the sign-in UI hides itself, and nothing is sent anywhere. That is the
# default and the recommended way to run it.
#
# Both variables must be set together for sync to switch on. Set one without the
# other and sync stays off.

# Your Supabase project URL. Must be a real, parseable http(s) URL. A leftover
# placeholder like https://<project-ref>.supabase.co is rejected with a clear
# console error and sync simply stays off — it will not blank the planner.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=

# The project's ANON (publishable) key — never the service-role key. Row-level
# security in supabase/migrations/0001_plans.sql is what protects the data.
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=
